The frontend test suite never runs in CI on this PR. Typecheck, build and Vitest are gated to PRs targeting main; this PR targets forensic_report_v2. Confirmed
Returning to the post-capture menu leads to a guaranteed error. The UI invites a second choice; the RPC is first-write-immutable and answers 409. Confirmed
Path-length asymmetry is 3 vs 14 vs 20 steps. The quote-in-hand user reaches capture in 3 taps; the quote-seeking user needs 14; the curious user needs about 20. Confirmed
